{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39198","headline":"江上逢史馆李学士 · 韦庄","name":"江上逢史馆李学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年分袂陕城西，醉凭征轩日欲低。\n去浪指期鱼必变，出门回首马空嘶。\n关河自此爲征垒，城阙於今陷战鼙。\n谁谓世途陵是谷，燕来还识旧巢泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}